---

## Pipeline SDD

```
/guidelines → /prd → [/clarify] → [/checklist] → /techspec → /spdd-canvas → /tasks → [/analyze] → /implement → [/spdd-sync] → /code-review
```

Skills entre colchetes `[/skill]` são opcionais mas recomendadas.

